Z||000003||AkursedX||09-13-2001||12:07 AM||||Well, I believe those articles are both very true.  But I don't think that most of America will buy that point of view.  America wants their revenge so it seems, no matter the impact.  <P>In school today, I found it very disappointing to find so many people with the attitude that we should just go in to Afghanistan and just kill everyone.  That's not going to solve the problem.  But trying to convince people otherwise was near-impossible.  I was actually accused of being supportive of whoever did this, just because I was trying to show people that there is more to the entire picture.<P>The only people I actually could have an intelligent conversation with were two of my professors.  And they brought forth many ideas that were mentioned in those articles.  <P>This is a delicate situation, and our government is going to have to be careful in how it moves foward.  But it should take action, that is a given.  <P><BR>On a sidenote:  Black88GT (I think that's what your screename was)  I have to correct myself about the legality of shooting down the plane.  After doing some more research with the guidance of one of my professors, I discovered that they would have legality in shooting the plane down.  So I was wrong about that.  But after looking more into it, I doubt more and more that they shot down the plane.  The passengers probably crashed it.<P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||California Kid||09-13-2001||12:24 AM||||Enough history is already known about Bin Laden and his followers that now terrifies 3/4 of the Countries on this planet. I think it's time that a "Unified" effort be made to exterminate these people from the planet.<P>This situation is far from over, they will strike again, and more innocent people will die, you can bet on it!!!  These people do not value life, don't care about dyeing, so let's just give them a helping hand to send them to their maker, as that's were they would rather be anyway. The way I look at it we'd be doing them and the world a great justice.<P>Excuse this post, but I'm really pissed that there are people on this planet that will tolerate the acts of this SOB and his followers, and I'm not just talking the most recent events. It may end of costing a few civilians lives to get these groups and their leaders, but in the long run it will save many lives and bring a better sense of peace to this planet. I don't even care if he was the one to order the attacks on 9/11.<P>Don't really know why I am going to post this, it's just my personal opinion at the present time, and I'm not in the best mental or physical condition to be dealing with this right now.<P>Just my opinion, I could be wrong.||||reg||1
