Z||000006||Mach10||09-13-2001||01:09 AM||||There's LOTS of good reasons not to retaliate. Unfortunately, The time for negotiation is passed. Action MUST be taken to prevent this from happening again. Contrary to what some people here think, I don't believe that massacring "rag-heads" will solve anything. The US military has made scalpels out of swords. Time to use them, and excise the festering tumors of terrorists from those coutries. If the Countries government is supporting terrorists, then attack that government too. A lot of blood will be spilled, but it is for a good cause. <P>God help us all.<BR>||||reg||13
